---
import catalog from '../../../data/martin/index.mjs';

const unit = catalog.parts[3].units[3];
const anchorFor = (sectionId) => `#section-${sectionId.replace('.', '-')}`;
---

<section id="source-map" class="chapter-source-map" aria-labelledby="chapter15-source-map-title">
  <h2 id="chapter15-source-map-title">来源地图 | Source Map</h2>
  <p>
    下表只记录 Martin 第 2 版目录定位与网站覆盖状态，不转录教材正文、图表或练习。
    <span lang="en">The table records second-edition locators and site coverage without reproducing textbook prose, figures, or exercises.</span>
  </p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>节 | Section</th>
        <th>Martin 标题 | Martin title</th>
        <th>印刷页 | Printed page</th>
        <th>网站位置 | Site position</th>
        <th>状态 | Status</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {unit.sections.map((section) => (
        <tr>
          <td>{section.id}</td>
          <td lang="en">{section.title}</td>
          <td>{section.page}</td>
          <td><a href={anchorFor(section.id)}>本页对应段落 | matching section</a></td>
          <td>正文与推导已填充 | body and derivations filled</td>
        </tr>
      ))}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p class="chapter-source-map__supplement">
    <strong>补充定位：</strong>Chapter 7（Kohn–Sham 能量与自洽）、Chapter 11（separable projectors/PAW）、Chapter 14（非正交局域基）、Appendix F（Coulomb 分解）、Appendix G（stress）、Appendix N（two-centre matrix elements）和 Chapter 18（locality/O(N)）。
  </p>
  <p class="chapter-source-map__supplement" lang="en">
    <strong>Supplemental locators:</strong> Chapter 7 for Kohn–Sham energy and self-consistency, Chapter 11 for separable projectors and PAW, Chapter 14 for nonorthogonal localized bases, Appendix F for Coulomb decompositions, Appendix G for stress, Appendix N for two-centre matrix elements, and Chapter 18 for locality and O(N) methods.
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .chapter-source-map__supplement {
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    border-left: 0.25rem solid var(--sl-color-accent);
    padding: 0.65rem 0.8rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-gray-6);
  }
</style>
